From 30eae4c81488a6d47bda41c3a272a1a3515e2937 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rawdanger-recomp <rawdanger-recomp@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:10:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] rawdanger-recomp v0.9.4: the hero's head follows the camera

Host call 202 (PS2_HEAD_FOLLOW) stands in for the call that builds each
bone's world matrix; for the player's head it turns the axes toward the
camera's heading, eased, only with the follow camera while playing.
Settings > Controls > Head follows camera (keys.ini head_follow, on).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QNLFPekqhcU2dj7B3Utmea
